OL,3,GNEWSANew prison unsafe when it opened,
OL,4,Asays report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new prison in East Yorkshire was
OL,7,F"unready, understaffed and unsafe upon
OL,8,Fopening", according to an inspection
OL,9,Freport.
OL,11,FThe Independent Monitoring Board (IMB)
OL,12,Ffor HMP Millsike said a lack of staff
OL,13,Fand workers' inexperience meant "its
OL,14,Fopening was chaotic, with basic
OL,15,Fprocesses, like drawing keys, locking
OL,16,Fdoors and counting prisoners, not yet
OL,17,Festablished".
OL,19,FThe Category C jail, run by Mitie Care
OL,20,F& Custody and designed to house 1,500
OL,21,Fprisoners, opened at a cost of about
OL,22,F#400m last year.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
