OL,3,GNEWSANew prison unsafe when it opened,
OL,4,Asays report
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response to the report, Mitie said
OL,7,Fit valued IMB oversight but "we do not
OL,8,Fbelieve its description of the prison
OL,9,Fat the time it opened [is] a fair or
OL,10,Faccurate reflection of the conditions
OL,11,Fat HMP Millsike".
